    "_doc": "gang/exception: neutral interactive writer skeleton. Major weight 1, party-wide cooldown 24 hours, exactly one female participant. Existing actor roles and COM IDs retained; one validated AP per phase, with separate preparation and AP success/failure branches. Full/first-only (where available)/skip choices differ in executed APs and final banked summary. No guaranteed physiological outcomes. Every ending redresses, returns all borrowed scopes, and resolves. Three non-AP handlers remain non-AP and record lastChoice (1=review, 0=skip) in a self relationship variable. Legacy dictionary keys retained as placeholders. No chronological order assumed.",
